@title Cabinet: Centre rails on devices puts each rail through the middle of its devices without moving them
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# An older plan (qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo) has rails off the middle of their devices. The Rails and
# ducts window (palette: rails) has a Centre rails on devices button: the rails move, the devices do not,
# and Ctrl+Z puts the rails back in one step. Pictures: before, the window, after.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text rails and ducts
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Centre rails on devices"
shot window
click_text "Centre rails on devices"
wait 10
expect "devices unmoved"
shot after
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot undone
click_text "Centre rails on devices"
wait 10
expect "devices unmoved"
